{"id":1483,"date":"2025-10-09T15:00:43","date_gmt":"2025-10-09T13:00:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/?p=1483"},"modified":"2025-10-09T15:00:43","modified_gmt":"2025-10-09T13:00:43","slug":"prince-abbe-de-sabourg-officially-received-by-the-prime-minister-of-guinea-conakry","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/en\/2025\/10\/09\/prince-abbe-de-sabourg-officially-received-by-the-prime-minister-of-guinea-conakry\/","title":{"rendered":"PRINCE ABBE DE SABOURG OFFICIALLY RECEIVED BY THE PRIME MINISTER OF GUINEA CONAKRY"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<h6>Conakry, January 22, 2025<\/h6>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\nOn January 22, Prince-Abbot Giovanni Luca of Sabourg was officially received by His Excellency Amadou Oury BAH, Prime Minister and Head of Government of Guinea Conakry.\r\nThe purpose of the meeting was to establish official relations between the two states on various levels in order to set up bilateral international cooperation.\r\n\r\nThe Prince-Abbot expressed his gratitude to Prime Minister H.E. Amadou Oury BAH for the important meeting that took place in Conakry: \u201cThere was a strong understanding on both sides, which will certainly enable the implementation of synergistic and relevant projects with Guinea, with the support of the Principality of Sabourg.\u201d\r\n\r\nThe Prince of Sabourg was then received by the Prime Minister&rsquo;s Chief of Staff, Minister Mohamed Lamine Sy Savan\u00e8. He then met with the Minister of Urban Planning and Land Use, Mory Conde, and finally with the Minister of Planning and International Cooperation, Mr. Ismael Nabe.\r\n\r\nThe Prime Minister was decorated as Grand Officer of the Order of the Crown by Prince Jean Luc, and the aforementioned ministers were decorated with the rank of Knight.\r\n\r\nThe Prince-Abbot paid a courtesy visit to the Archbishop of the Archdiocese of Conakry, His Excellency Vincent Coulibaly, and then to the Grand Mosque of Conakry, where he was received by the Council of Imams, who presented the Prince of Sabourg with a copy of the Koran as a sign of religious brotherhood.\r\n\r\nThe official mission to Guinea Conakry ended with an official visit to the President of the National Transitional Council, H.E. Dr. Dansa Kouoma, and his advisors.\r\nThe President of the CNT presented Prince-Abate with a copy of the CNT Constitution, which will be adopted shortly.\r\nThe Sovereign of Sabourg said: \u00ab\u00a0<strong>This is a great privilege that confirms the futuristic vision that places the Principality of Sabourg as a strategic partner for economic development, international cooperation, and religious interaction on the African continent.<\/strong>\r\n\r\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1097 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-1024x599.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"599\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-1024x599.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-300x175.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-768x449.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-1536x899.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-24x14.jpg 24w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-36x21.jpg 36w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1-48x28.jpg 48w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/473533162_940501848171708_8010719105155063463_n-1.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\r\n\r\n<figure id=\"attachment_1103\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1103\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1103 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-300x240.jpg\" alt=\"Visite au Premier Ministre \u00e0 Conakry\" width=\"300\" height=\"240\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-300x240.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-1024x819.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-768x614.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-24x19.jpg 24w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-36x29.jpg 36w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n-48x38.jpg 48w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474527759_940501828171710_1311268940748869148_n.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1103\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Visit to the Prime Minister in Conakry<\/figcaption><\/figure>\r\n\r\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1101 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/474545634_940421704846389_3407416361333625283_n-300x243.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"243\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sabo